WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Guile begins the first Rush with visible space behind Manon before the wall.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.550
Standing medium punch connects against standing Manon.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.350
Down-forward heavy kick follows the medium.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.150
OD Sonic Boom pushes the airborne opponent toward the corner.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:03.700
Guile Rushes forward again after the projectile.

6
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.450
Standing heavy kick catches the carried opponent.

7
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:04.900
Heavy Flash Kick connects after the Rush juggle.

8
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:13.850
Guile cancels into low-health Crossfire Somersault.

9
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.000
The Critical Art finishes after the carry reaches the wall.
